    "text": "madisoniannews.com\nwebsite\nVirginia City\nGovernor Gianforte visited Nevada and Virginia City to tout new 99 year leases for Heritage Commission properties\nBy MATI BISHOP,\n5 hours agoGovernor Greg Gianforte rolled through Virginia and Nevada City on Aug. 26 to bring attention to the new approach to public private partnerships for the Montana Heritage Commission (MHC) properties that was brought to fruition by the passage of representative Ken Walsh’s HB 680 in the 2025 Montana Legislature session.\n1",
